WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.709 --> 00:00:01.292
LARRY DAVID: Gag gift?

00:00:01.835 --> 00:00:03.128
No, that's a real gift.
You've never had one?

00:00:03.211 --> 00:00:04.796
-You ever played around
 with one?
-LARRY: No!

00:00:05.004 --> 00:00:06.172
You cuddle it.
Whatever your journey is.

00:00:06.256 --> 00:00:07.632
♪ ("EL DESEO"
BY JANET SHERBOURNE PLAYS) ♪

00:00:07.716 --> 00:00:09.384
What exactly do you see
in this man?

00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:12.470
I think behind
those dark clothes lies a--

00:00:12.554 --> 00:00:14.431
(LAUGHS) Very pretentious man?

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:16.391
So, the bathroom's
gonna be over there.

00:00:16.599 --> 00:00:17.976
I've got a lot of ideas
for the urinals.

00:00:18.059 --> 00:00:19.477
You wanna redesign a urinal?

00:00:19.561 --> 00:00:20.937
-Elevated planks.
-Great.

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:22.272
Your feet never touch
the ground.

00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:24.899
-Why?
-That's where the puddles are.

00:00:25.275 --> 00:00:27.444
Do you know what it takes to
stand up there for 90 minutes,

00:00:27.527 --> 00:00:28.570
one-man play?

00:00:28.778 --> 00:00:29.946
It must be quite grueling.

00:00:30.029 --> 00:00:32.073
One wonders why
somebody would do it.

00:00:32.615 --> 00:00:34.617
♪ (MUSIC CONCLUDES) ♪

